87
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:05.714
No. Give the reviewer a redacted timeline,
targets, versions, containment,

88
00:10:05.714 --> 00:10:11.429
evidence references, uncertainty, and
required decision. Include content only

89
00:10:11.429 --> 00:10:17.143
when policy, purpose, permission, access,
and retention justify it. Hidden

90
00:10:17.143 --> 00:10:22.857
reasoning is not required for operational
accountability. If you chose

91
00:10:22.857 --> 00:10:28.571
full capture for convenience, return to
data minimization. If you

92
00:10:28.571 --> 00:10:34.286
removed every detail, add enough governed
evidence to reproduce the

93
00:10:34.286 --> 00:10:40.000
