recovery.

94
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:46.400
Open the trace review activity. Define
spans for agent, model,

95
00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:52.800
retrieval, tool, approval, handoff,
verification, and recovery. Add quality,

96
00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:59.200
